**Low difficulty** — All four tasks are "find" (visual identification) tasks. The player needs to:
- Recognize a small dark_oak_button on a stone brick wall (moderate difficulty — buttons are small)
- Recognize red_glazed_terracotta's distinctive swirl pattern on the floor (easy — very colorful)
